WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Define columns appropriate to the available space.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Let card content determine its own height.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Avoid a minimum column width larger than the viewport.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Exercise: compare one-column and two-column layouts.
